          "text": "Circumcision is explicitly called the covenant’s bodily sign. The command includes males born in Abraham’s household and those bought from outside it, so the covenant boundary is drawn around the whole household rather than only Abraham’s biological descendants. The chapter presents this as a covenant practice, not as an argument about modern medicine.",
