          "text": "Romans reads Genesis 15 and Genesis 17 together, emphasizing that Abraham’s trust was reckoned before circumcision became the covenant sign. In that reading, this sequence supports the inclusion of Gentiles without treating Jewish circumcision as worthless or shameful.",
